5:["$","p",null,{"children":["Start with vowel-rich openers to map the word quickly. Say candidate words out loud — pronunciation often surfaces options your eyes miss. When you are stuck, write down the confirmed letters and deliberately list words that fit; that little struggle is where the learning happens. And when you miss a day, use the ",["$","$L4",null,{"href":"/","children":"archive"}]," ","to keep practising — every past puzzle remains playable."]}]
6:["$","h2",null,{"children":"Who Is It For?"}]
7:["$","p",null,{"children":["Students preparing for exams get daily spelling and vocabulary reps. Professionals keep their English quick and precise. Families turn it into a friendly competition over who needs the fewest guesses. If you have been looking for a ",["$","$L4",null,{"href":"/guess-the-word-game","children":"guess the word game"}]," that doubles as genuine practice, this is it — free, and a new session starts every midnight."]}]
